   "title": "Beneath the Facade",
   "description": "Taehyung woke up and gazed at his reflection, his explosive hair, tattoos, and rugged features staring back at him like a demon. \n\nIn his past life, he was trapped in a loveless marriage, desperate to escape his husband, whom he detested with every fiber of his being. His past life was a blur of mistakes and heartache, culminating in a disastrous romance that cost him everything, including his freedom. \n\nHe tried to escape his marriage to the outstandingly beautiful husband he didn't want, but ended up getting brainwashed by his best friend instead. \n\nIn this lifetime, all of the evil people scheming and longing for his divorce should yield. Reborn, Taehyung was determined to rewrite his destiny, no longer the naive boy who'd been blind to the truth.\n\n(Most images used are AI-generated; any non-AI images will be credited to their rightful owners.)\n\nTop: Jungkook \nBottom: Taehyung \n\nDisclaimer: This story is a BL fan-adapted version of a chinese novel.\n\nMangaToon got authorization from Ava77 to publish this work, the content is the author's own point of view, and does not represent the stand of MangaToon.",
