   "title": "Rebirth:The Fake Heiress Returns",
   "description": "Twenty years ago, Kim Taehyung was taken into the powerful Kim family as their young heir due to a twist of fate. He grew up believing he belonged, pouring his love and loyalty into the family. When the real heir returned, Taehyung intended to leave, but the Kim couple begged him to stay. Trusting their affection, he remained—unaware that they only kept him to exploit his worth.\nEverything collapsed when Taehyung woke up in a hotel room with his future brother-in-law. Reporters swarmed him before he could escape. His childhood friend accused him of scheming, while the sister Taehyung had cherished slapped him in public. The Kim matriarch denounced him to the media and severed all ties, destroying his reputation overnight.\nBefore Tae could clear his name, he died in an accident and learned the truth—his downfall was orchestrated by the real heir. Filled with regret and resentment, he was reborn.\n\n\nanother adaption of taekook story ♥️\nAll credit goes to original owner 👀\n\nMangaToon got authorization from mini princess to publish this work, the content is the author's own point of view, and does not represent the stand of MangaToon.",
