   "description": "Jeon Jungkook, the forgotten last son of a powerful entertainment empire, is known as a talentless omega, a burden, and a disgrace to his family. Loved by none and understood by fewer, he lives in the shadow of perfect siblings and a world obsessed with image.\n\nBut when death takes his broken life, a new soul awakens inside his body.\n\nKookie, a poor mechanic and underground racer, opens his eyes in luxury he never wanted. No longer chasing love or approval, he turns to one thing that feels real—speed.\n\nIn a world built to ignore him, he begins to rise through pure velocity.\n\nTop: Taehyung \nBottom: Kookie\n\nMangaToon got authorization from H.Bloom to publish this work, the content is the author's own point of view, and does not represent the stand of MangaToon.",
