   "title": "ARRANGE BY HIM",
   "description": "She was the daughter of his greatest enemy.\n\nHe was the ruthless Mafia King—feared by everyone, trusted by no one, and never known to show mercy. When revenge became more important than peace, he arranged a marriage with the one person his enemy could never refuse... his daughter.\n\nShe walked into the marriage believing she was nothing more than a sacrifice. He married her believing she was only a weapon in his revenge.\n\nBut what happens when the girl he was supposed to hate becomes the only one capable of breaking the walls around his heart?\n\nIn a world ruled by power, betrayal, blood, and dangerous secrets, love is the greatest risk of all.\n\nWill revenge win... or will love rewrite their destiny?\n\nMangaToon got authorization from diksha  to publish this work, the content is the author's own point of view, and does not represent the stand of MangaToon.",
